WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 19]

01:52.740 --> 01:54.340
Are you their new Demon King?

01:54.660 --> 01:55.140
No.

01:55.940 --> 01:57.140
Then why are you here?

01:59.660 --> 02:01.180
Thank you for protecting my whole clan

02:01.180 --> 02:02.820
in the Palace of Abyssal Mirrors.

02:02.820 --> 02:03.750
At the same time,

02:04.340 --> 02:06.200
I also want to tell you something.

02:07.100 --> 02:07.740
What is it?

02:08.820 --> 02:09.940
Aquatic Demons

02:10.580 --> 02:12.640
were once the King of the demon world.

02:34.579 --> 02:36.420
I've investigated it thoroughly.

02:36.420 --> 02:37.300
These demons

02:37.620 --> 02:39.480
killed people outside recently.

02:39.980 --> 02:41.110
They deserve to die.

02:42.500 --> 02:45.160
Accessories should also be punished slightly.

02:45.260 --> 02:47.060
Those who refuse to be moralized

02:47.140 --> 02:48.620
and still want to kill

02:49.980 --> 02:51.780
should be killed without mercy.

02:57.500 --> 02:58.740
The other demons

02:59.100 --> 03:00.500
will serve me as the king,

03:00.820 --> 03:02.010
be restricted by me,

03:02.460 --> 03:04.190
and never cross the line again.

03:06.820 --> 03:08.820
I don't know who your new Demon King is.

03:08.820 --> 03:09.740
But now,

03:10.180 --> 03:12.040
if you don't regard me as the king,

03:12.300 --> 03:14.030
all you can do is waiting to die.

03:15.700 --> 03:17.620
Greetings, Demon King in White.

03:23.260 --> 03:23.940
This

03:28.100 --> 03:29.100
is not up to you.

03:40.620 --> 03:41.660
Immortal, let me

03:41.660 --> 03:43.260
deal with this trifle.

03:44.820 --> 03:45.380
Move.

03:51.730 --> 03:52.390
Liu Shao!

03:56.140 --> 03:57.140
Brother.

03:58.530 --> 03:59.500
It's really you.

03:59.900 --> 04:00.580
Brother.

04:02.140 --> 04:02.500
Brother.

04:02.500 --> 04:03.960
You came at the right time.

04:04.010 --> 04:04.940
He's my brother.

04:05.540 --> 04:06.090
Brother.

04:08.340 --> 04:09.540
Who is your brother?

04:10.260 --> 04:11.300
I'm Luo Ge.

04:13.300 --> 04:14.560
Aren't you my brother?

04:21.339 --> 04:22.290
What happened?

04:23.100 --> 04:26.430
Where is the Protection Spell of Marquis Wuyang's Mansion?

04:26.740 --> 04:27.820
Since the Lord died,

04:27.820 --> 04:29.980
no one has reinforced the Protection Spell.

04:29.980 --> 04:31.530
And the demons keep attacking

04:31.530 --> 04:33.060
Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

04:33.460 --> 04:34.220
Today,

04:34.220 --> 04:36.020
the protection spell was broken.

04:36.020 --> 04:38.890
That's why Marquis Wuyang's Mansion suffered this disaster.

04:38.890 --> 04:40.100
Even Captain Fang...

04:43.780 --> 04:45.440
Captain Fang was also killed.

04:46.380 --> 04:49.220
A lot disciples of Marquis Wuyang's Mansion were injured.

04:49.220 --> 04:50.550
Even though we escaped,

04:50.580 --> 04:51.980
we don't know where to go.

04:52.180 --> 04:53.240
If this continues,

04:54.210 --> 04:56.330
the mortal world will become the demons' territory.

04:56.330 --> 04:58.860
Even Marquis Wuyang's Mansion was defeated?

05:08.180 --> 05:08.730
Brother.

05:08.980 --> 05:09.900
Where did he go?

05:11.820 --> 05:12.700
That direction

05:13.770 --> 05:15.830
should be Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

05:39.600 --> 05:40.610
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

06:00.380 --> 06:01.640
The Protection Spell.

06:24.620 --> 06:25.700
The Protection Spell!

06:25.700 --> 06:27.960
Immortal rebuilt the Protection Spell!

06:28.140 --> 06:28.900
With it,

06:29.020 --> 06:29.700
Marquis Wuyang's Mansion

06:29.700 --> 06:31.060
may emerge again.

06:31.420 --> 06:31.900
That's right.

06:31.900 --> 06:32.100
Yeah.

06:32.100 --> 06:32.700
Yes.

06:32.900 --> 06:33.540
Great!

06:33.620 --> 06:34.100
There's hope.

06:34.100 --> 06:34.630
Let's go.

06:34.659 --> 06:35.060
Come on.

06:35.060 --> 06:35.590
Let's go.

07:17.740 --> 07:18.370
Brother!

07:18.980 --> 07:19.580
Brother!

07:21.620 --> 07:22.340
Brother!

07:26.420 --> 07:27.060
Brother!

07:27.420 --> 07:27.950
Brother.

07:28.540 --> 07:29.000
Well...

07:29.580 --> 07:30.940
Rebuilt the Protection Spell?

07:30.940 --> 07:33.000
How much immortal energy did it take?

07:36.140 --> 07:38.870
It's stronger than the Lord's Protection Spell.

07:39.260 --> 07:41.460
I'm truly in awe.

07:43.020 --> 07:44.080
If you want to do it,

07:44.420 --> 07:46.080
there's nothing you can't do.

07:46.740 --> 07:47.100
Okay.

07:47.810 --> 07:48.460
One day,

07:49.300 --> 07:52.420
I will regain the reputation of Marquis Wuyang's Mansion

07:52.420 --> 07:54.750
and become the master of the mortal world,

07:54.780 --> 07:57.040
making the mortal world free from demons

07:57.700 --> 07:59.300
and become a peaceful world.

08:01.820 --> 08:03.140
Stop bragging.

08:04.860 --> 08:06.300
Look at you, Xue.

08:06.300 --> 08:07.560
Why don't you trust me?

08:07.620 --> 08:08.940
Look, the Protection Spell has been rebuilt.

08:08.940 --> 08:09.780
Indeed.

08:09.940 --> 08:10.540
He Na

08:11.970 --> 08:15.370
is also an interesting person who matches your temperament.

08:17.700 --> 08:18.420
I guess so.

08:28.300 --> 08:29.060
Who would believe that?

08:29.060 --> 08:30.320
You can ask my brother.

08:31.500 --> 08:32.059
Well.

08:32.220 --> 08:32.820
Brother.

08:33.860 --> 08:34.580
Brother.

08:36.220 --> 08:37.150
My brother left?

08:37.460 --> 08:38.010
Yes.

08:38.380 --> 08:39.179
Steping on lotus,

08:39.179 --> 08:41.140
he went back to Xiyin Mountain in a moment.

08:41.140 --> 08:42.539
Really?

08:42.900 --> 08:43.890
It's just that

08:44.179 --> 08:45.780
he seems angry.

08:46.580 --> 08:47.980
Is it because you

08:47.980 --> 08:49.640
helped He Na escape secretly?

08:50.780 --> 08:52.710
Actually, He Na has helped us a lot.

08:53.770 --> 08:54.580
But

08:56.090 --> 08:57.460
he's now Luo Ge.

08:58.900 --> 09:00.380
He doesn't remember anything about Lu Li.

09:00.380 --> 09:01.310
Sister-in-law.

09:02.140 --> 09:03.220
I finally believe

09:03.940 --> 09:05.020
Immortal Luo Ge

09:05.180 --> 09:06.610
is my brother, Lu Li.

09:07.140 --> 09:09.070
He's much more capable than before

09:09.180 --> 09:10.740
and his temper has changed

09:11.580 --> 09:11.940
but

09:12.740 --> 09:13.940
he's still good at

09:14.140 --> 09:15.540
driving people crazy.

09:17.060 --> 09:18.300
He came by

09:18.570 --> 09:20.460
and protected all of us.

09:20.660 --> 09:22.260
I am sure about my intuition.

09:23.180 --> 09:25.180
It's true that he's good at driving people crazy.

09:25.180 --> 09:27.100
He went back to Xiyin Mountain in an instant.

09:27.100 --> 09:28.030
What should I do?

09:29.220 --> 09:31.420
Should I crawl back on an empty stomach?

09:33.180 --> 09:33.930
How about

09:34.060 --> 09:35.100
go back after eating?

09:35.100 --> 09:35.660
Let's go.

09:36.220 --> 09:37.690
My drumstick is waiting for you.

09:37.690 --> 09:38.220
Let's go.

09:38.260 --> 09:38.820
And...

09:39.060 --> 09:40.260
And trotters, right?

09:40.380 --> 09:41.180
And trotters.

09:49.140 --> 09:49.890
Brother.

09:51.980 --> 09:52.620
Brother.

09:54.180 --> 09:54.860
Brother.

09:55.900 --> 09:56.580
Brother.

09:58.740 --> 09:59.420
Fairy.

10:00.940 --> 10:02.500
Immortal went into seclusion as soon as he came back.

10:02.500 --> 10:04.030
He said he won't see anyone.

10:04.660 --> 10:05.720
Not seeing anyone?

10:09.180 --> 10:10.060
Who are you?

10:10.180 --> 10:11.180
Where is Liu Shao?

10:11.940 --> 10:13.460
I’m the lady-in-waiting sent by the Immortal Master of Palace Wuji

10:13.460 --> 10:14.940
to serve Immortal.

10:15.220 --> 10:16.280
My name is Bai Feng.

10:16.780 --> 10:17.910
Liu Shao is not here.

10:18.180 --> 10:21.040
I guess she's staying in Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

10:21.940 --> 10:22.820
Did she

10:23.020 --> 10:24.540
forget about my matter?

10:25.180 --> 10:27.220
You mean...

10:28.260 --> 10:29.520
It's nothing serious.

10:29.900 --> 10:30.580
But

10:30.650 --> 10:32.380
don't tell them I've been here.

10:49.900 --> 10:51.360
The poison of Brahma Lotus

10:51.820 --> 10:53.020
has been detoxified.

10:54.140 --> 10:55.940
Why hasn't the wound healed yet?

10:57.020 --> 10:58.420
Even the spiritual power

10:58.940 --> 11:00.460
are still weakening.

11:03.380 --> 11:04.140
Immortal.

11:04.780 --> 11:05.500
Immortal.

11:05.820 --> 11:06.780
Are you inside?

11:07.380 --> 11:09.440
Immortal Master sent me to serve you.

11:21.820 --> 11:22.540
Lu Li.

11:23.740 --> 11:24.820
Is that you?

11:26.260 --> 11:28.450
I will get you this time.

11:32.940 --> 11:33.860
Liu Shao.

11:35.060 --> 11:35.980
Get out.

11:37.420 --> 11:38.060
Get out!

11:46.340 --> 11:47.570
Liu Shao.

11:48.700 --> 11:50.180
Liu Shao again.

11:54.740 --> 11:56.020
The person around you

11:57.380 --> 11:58.740
can only be me.

12:03.940 --> 12:05.380
None of them is here.

12:06.420 --> 12:07.940
How boring.

12:20.500 --> 12:21.220
Brother,

12:21.380 --> 12:23.420
I heard you brought a bad guy

12:23.500 --> 12:24.820
back to Xiyin Mountain.

12:24.820 --> 12:25.780
Can I

12:25.820 --> 12:26.700
practice magic

12:26.780 --> 12:27.840
and hit him for fun?

12:27.860 --> 12:28.530
No.

12:29.940 --> 12:31.940
The person is sinister and cunning.

12:32.180 --> 12:34.310
Don't even think about getting close.

12:34.700 --> 12:35.890
I set a restriction

12:36.260 --> 12:37.860
in the place where he is imprisoned.

12:37.860 --> 12:39.940
As long as you get close to him within one inch,

12:39.940 --> 12:41.000
I'll find out soon.

12:56.740 --> 12:58.340
Brother is lying to me again.

12:58.340 --> 13:00.070
There's no restriction at all.

13:01.530 --> 13:03.620
Who is the fairy outside?

13:10.300 --> 13:11.660
Can you chat with me?

13:17.860 --> 13:18.740
Tell me.

13:19.780 --> 13:22.130
What despicable things have you done

13:22.740 --> 13:24.070
that made you arrested?

13:24.860 --> 13:26.500
If I say I'm innocent,

13:27.060 --> 13:28.060
do you believe me?

13:33.420 --> 13:36.100
Fu, General of Water

13:37.340 --> 13:40.140
and the younger brother of the Demon King in White.

13:40.340 --> 13:42.300
If you say you're innocent,

13:42.780 --> 13:43.900
I'm afraid

13:44.020 --> 13:45.750
no one is villain in this world.

13:53.650 --> 13:54.540
You know me?

13:56.900 --> 13:57.940
My brother

13:58.180 --> 13:59.460
never let me know about the demon world

13:59.460 --> 14:00.540
since I was little,

14:01.460 --> 14:03.920
as if I have a grudge against the demon world.

14:04.170 --> 14:05.500
But if I want to know,

14:05.980 --> 14:07.640
there's nothing I can't know.

14:08.180 --> 14:09.460
Not only do I know you,

14:09.820 --> 14:10.780
I also know

14:10.820 --> 14:13.350
you are totally different from your brother.

14:13.540 --> 14:14.420
You

14:14.450 --> 14:16.100
are called General of Water

14:16.460 --> 14:18.340
but you don't usually use water as weapon.

14:18.340 --> 14:20.820
Your weapon is a curved knife.

14:20.980 --> 14:23.140
Besides, you're ruthless.

14:25.540 --> 14:27.780
You seem quite free now.

14:28.020 --> 14:30.080
Why don't you play your curved knife?

14:30.260 --> 14:31.180
If I do it well,

14:31.620 --> 14:32.680
will you reward me?

14:33.300 --> 14:33.820
Sure.

14:34.140 --> 14:35.060
Of course.

15:22.300 --> 15:23.780
What do you think?

15:24.210 --> 15:25.260
Not bad.

15:25.620 --> 15:26.380
I knew it.

15:26.460 --> 15:29.180
Your moves are different from the ones from the Immortal Palace.

15:29.180 --> 15:31.300
What do you plan to reward me?

15:32.010 --> 15:33.420
I reward...

15:34.530 --> 15:36.930
I reward you sending me a birthday present.

15:40.620 --> 15:42.150
Since I am imprisoned here,

15:42.460 --> 15:44.120
I'm afraid that's hard for me.

15:44.500 --> 15:45.760
This is your business.

15:46.460 --> 15:47.620
At least tell me

15:47.620 --> 15:48.700
what's your name.

15:49.500 --> 15:51.030
That's also your business.

15:51.180 --> 15:52.380
I like smart people.

15:53.500 --> 15:54.940
If you are smart,

15:55.020 --> 15:56.750
I'll visit you again next time.

16:08.900 --> 16:10.620
Smart people?

16:11.900 --> 16:13.380
Interesting.

16:41.460 --> 16:42.260
Your Majesty.

16:43.450 --> 16:44.140
Mr. Tai.

16:44.620 --> 16:45.820
Is everything ready?

16:45.980 --> 16:47.060
Yes.

16:47.620 --> 16:49.260
Are you in a hurry to use them?

16:49.900 --> 16:50.340
Yes.

16:51.740 --> 16:54.220
Liu Shao was afraid that I'd suffer losses if I had a conflict with Luo Ge

16:54.220 --> 16:55.180
and stopped him

16:55.500 --> 16:56.560
so that I can leave.

16:57.780 --> 16:59.100
But those people in the Immortal Palace

16:59.100 --> 17:01.020
have been prejudiced against the Demons

17:01.020 --> 17:02.350
and don't like Liu Shao.

17:03.180 --> 17:05.020
Since she protected me like that,

17:05.020 --> 17:07.420
I'm afraid they may vent their anger on her.

17:08.020 --> 17:08.780
In this case,

17:08.819 --> 17:10.880
you have to go to the Immortal Palace.

17:11.260 --> 17:12.579
You may also see

17:12.980 --> 17:14.859
if you can visit General Fu.

17:40.060 --> 17:42.180
Is Immortal Tightwad

17:42.260 --> 17:43.330
still angry?

17:44.500 --> 17:45.500
Immortal.

17:45.620 --> 17:47.130
Liu Shao is back.

17:47.500 --> 17:49.700
Liu Shao hereby apologize to Immortal.

18:09.020 --> 18:10.500
I admit

18:10.940 --> 18:13.460
that I didn't protect Immortal,

18:13.810 --> 18:16.620
but stop you and let He Na leave.

18:17.420 --> 18:18.300
I know

18:18.580 --> 18:21.710
Immortal was angry because the demons crossed the line.

18:22.010 --> 18:22.780
But Immortal,

18:22.780 --> 18:24.510
have you ever thought about it?

18:25.220 --> 18:26.660
Marquis Wuyang's Mansion

18:26.660 --> 18:28.520
keeps killing demons every year.

18:28.620 --> 18:30.700
But the mortal world is still not peaceful.

18:30.700 --> 18:32.980
It's not because Marquis Wuyang's Mansion is not strong enough,

18:32.980 --> 18:34.910
but because the demons lack a king.

18:35.020 --> 18:37.020
A king that can control them.

18:37.740 --> 18:38.340
It's true.

18:38.580 --> 18:41.380
Today, Immortal can give a warning to everyone by killing one demon.

18:41.380 --> 18:42.140
But what if

18:42.260 --> 18:43.580
they do it again in the future?

18:43.580 --> 18:45.620
Will Immortal choose to kill them again?

18:45.620 --> 18:47.180
If Immortal chooses counterviolence,

18:47.180 --> 18:49.980
why do you need to cultivate your mind all the time?

19:00.890 --> 19:01.550
Who are you?

19:03.060 --> 19:04.060
How did you get in?

19:07.090 --> 19:07.860
I...

19:12.620 --> 19:13.020
I...

19:13.540 --> 19:14.460
I'm done.

19:17.100 --> 19:19.220
I will kneel here for two hours.

19:19.420 --> 19:20.700
Because I think kneeling for two hours

19:20.700 --> 19:22.140
is enough for my fault.

19:23.370 --> 19:24.380
I'll kneel then.

19:27.020 --> 19:28.580
I kneeled.

19:31.980 --> 19:32.580
Immortal.

19:34.260 --> 19:35.590
Who told you to stand up?

19:36.300 --> 19:37.980
Didn't you say you need to kneel for two hours?

19:37.980 --> 19:38.640
Kneel down.

19:44.740 --> 19:45.300
Wait.

19:45.660 --> 19:46.740
Why is she here?

19:47.100 --> 19:48.570
What did you do last night?

19:49.540 --> 19:51.070
You've been here all night?

19:51.340 --> 19:52.340
You care about it?

19:52.540 --> 19:53.820
Of course I do!

19:57.100 --> 19:57.900
You may leave.

19:58.980 --> 20:00.310
Without my permission,

20:00.660 --> 20:03.260
you can't enter Palace Chonghua in the future.

20:08.940 --> 20:10.020
You're pretending.

20:10.020 --> 20:11.280
Just keep pretending.

20:24.780 --> 20:25.860
Keep your words.

20:26.380 --> 20:29.110
Kneel here for two hours before you come to see me.

20:33.140 --> 20:33.940
You and her...

20:51.460 --> 20:55.100
That bad woman spent the whole night...

20:56.450 --> 20:57.860
What does she want?

21:31.740 --> 21:32.580
Who let you in?

21:34.820 --> 21:36.950
You still have to kneel for 15 minutes.

21:38.140 --> 21:38.690
Get out.

21:45.460 --> 21:46.100
Serve tea.

21:47.820 --> 21:48.370
Coming.

21:50.260 --> 21:51.390
Who asked you to sit?

22:09.660 --> 22:10.780
Bai Feng

22:10.940 --> 22:12.420
is Lu Li's senior

22:13.020 --> 22:14.620
but she's not a good person.

22:15.860 --> 22:17.300
Why is she here?

22:29.020 --> 22:31.820
Immortal Master sent her to serve in Palace Chonghua.

22:31.820 --> 22:32.880
I can't refuse her.

22:51.500 --> 22:52.780
Since you care so much,

22:55.900 --> 22:58.430
I can stop her from coming to Palace Chonghua.

22:59.020 --> 23:01.100
She'll only be in charge of the area around Xiyin Mountain.

23:01.100 --> 23:02.130
That makes sense.

23:06.300 --> 23:08.160
He Na came to the Immortal Palace.

23:19.740 --> 23:21.340
I just received the news that

23:22.340 --> 23:24.870
he seems to have arrived at the Litian Temple.

23:25.700 --> 23:27.830
He said he wants to see me for pleading.

23:32.300 --> 23:33.380
Did he come so fast

23:36.620 --> 23:39.020
because he doesn't want you to suffer here?

23:43.620 --> 23:46.260
You know that He Na

23:46.540 --> 23:47.940
is very loyal to friends.

23:48.260 --> 23:49.790
He treats Lu Li the same way.

23:51.980 --> 23:53.110
Maybe you're right.

23:55.340 --> 23:57.940
Counterviolence is not a long-term solution.

23:59.180 --> 24:00.440
You have convinced me.

24:01.420 --> 24:03.220
The demon world does need a king.

24:06.260 --> 24:08.920
If you can persuade others in the Litian Temple,

24:10.060 --> 24:11.920
I can consider teaching you magic

24:15.250 --> 24:17.310
to protect those you want to protect.

24:22.060 --> 24:23.450
Actually,

24:23.620 --> 24:26.020
the person I want to protect the most is you.

24:36.460 --> 24:37.340
But

24:38.140 --> 24:40.200
I don't think you need my protection.

24:51.460 --> 24:52.320
I'm so thirsty.

25:05.860 --> 25:08.060
The Aquatic Demons is really talented.

25:08.260 --> 25:11.940
How dare you come to the Immortal palace and bargain with us in public?

25:11.940 --> 25:13.820
Do you think we

25:14.090 --> 25:15.420
really forgot

25:15.420 --> 25:16.980
what the Demon King did?

25:17.340 --> 25:19.500
Although the former Demon King is guilty,

25:19.500 --> 25:21.180
our clan has been living in the water

25:21.180 --> 25:22.510
for ten thousand years.

25:24.580 --> 25:26.910
You demons keep harming the mortal world.

25:27.220 --> 25:29.100
Have you ever thought about stopping?

25:29.100 --> 25:32.060
If Immortal Luo Ge hadn't arrived,

25:32.260 --> 25:35.190
you would have destroyed Marquis Wuyang's mansion.

25:36.660 --> 25:37.410
Immortal,

25:38.140 --> 25:39.730
that's why I'm here today.

25:42.100 --> 25:43.420
Tell me what you think.

25:52.780 --> 25:53.980
Since our clan hid underwater,

25:53.980 --> 25:55.820
those demons on land

25:56.100 --> 25:58.360
split apart and entrenched separately.

25:58.460 --> 26:00.460
They divided into four major clans.

26:01.100 --> 26:02.300
When Ao Hen was alive,

26:02.460 --> 26:04.190
her clan was the most powerful.

26:04.300 --> 26:05.340
After her death,

26:05.860 --> 26:08.020
they've been fighting each other.

26:08.580 --> 26:11.510
Plus, they've been instigated by an unknown person.

26:12.420 --> 26:13.900
That's why they repeatedly violated the realm

26:13.900 --> 26:15.260
and harmed the human race.

26:15.260 --> 26:16.590
Then what are you doing?

26:17.380 --> 26:19.660
There is an unwritten rule in the demon world.

26:19.660 --> 26:20.980
If you surrender to someone,

26:20.980 --> 26:22.500
you have to give out your demon energy

26:22.500 --> 26:23.980
and swear with blood

26:24.100 --> 26:25.700
as a token of eternal obedience

26:25.700 --> 26:26.900
and eternal loyalty.

26:30.300 --> 26:31.740
You mean

26:32.140 --> 26:34.140
you have subdued a clan?

26:34.420 --> 26:35.020
Yes.

26:37.540 --> 26:39.940
I've subdued the Northwest Demons.

26:40.580 --> 26:42.020
I hereby swear

26:42.420 --> 26:44.280
I will regain the glory of our clan

26:44.500 --> 26:46.230
and become the real Demon King,

26:46.770 --> 26:48.380
leading the demons

26:48.620 --> 26:50.820
to live peacefully with the human race.

26:51.740 --> 26:53.540
So this is your bargaining chip.

26:53.620 --> 26:54.860
What do you want?

27:02.380 --> 27:04.180
Demons won't offend the human race,

27:04.180 --> 27:06.220
the human race should not offend us either.

27:06.220 --> 27:08.080
Even if it's the immortal Palace,

27:08.100 --> 27:10.100
they should treat our clan equally.

27:10.140 --> 27:11.100
That's all?

27:12.220 --> 27:13.480
I also want my brother,

27:14.380 --> 27:15.300
Fu.

27:22.220 --> 27:24.860
You demons never act in good faith.

27:25.060 --> 27:26.940
Who knows what you’re up to?

27:29.100 --> 27:29.700
Ge,

27:29.940 --> 27:30.940
what do you think?

27:31.340 --> 27:33.140
If you agree to

27:33.380 --> 27:35.580
the idea the Demon King raised just now,

27:35.660 --> 27:36.860
please step forward.

27:53.900 --> 27:56.230
Looks like you're the only one who agrees.

27:56.500 --> 27:57.780
Tell us what you think.

28:12.660 --> 28:14.380
Immortal Master, do you think

28:14.460 --> 28:15.500
among the three worlds,

28:15.500 --> 28:16.460
the demon world is the worst

28:16.460 --> 28:17.580
and that even if it will disappear,

28:17.580 --> 28:18.440
it's not a pity?

28:18.860 --> 28:20.060
It is known to all that

28:20.300 --> 28:21.630
demons are despicable.

28:21.860 --> 28:23.540
But why are there four seasons in the mortal world?

28:23.540 --> 28:24.820
Spring, summer, autumn, and winter.

28:24.820 --> 28:25.740
The winter is known for its coldness.

28:25.740 --> 28:27.140
Should we also give it up?

28:27.300 --> 28:28.960
Without winter hibernation,

28:29.090 --> 28:31.220
there will not be the breeze in spring.

28:31.410 --> 28:32.420
Little girl,

28:32.620 --> 28:34.180
don't try to trap me.

28:34.420 --> 28:35.740
The rule of the four seasons

28:35.740 --> 28:37.460
is also true for the three worlds.

28:37.460 --> 28:38.940
The demon world has been around for tens of thousands of years.

28:38.940 --> 28:41.290
There must be a reason for their existence.

28:41.290 --> 28:44.220
But it's also true that demons love killing cruelly.

28:44.340 --> 28:47.170
I can't tolerate their killing.

28:47.500 --> 28:48.500
I am incompetent.

28:49.580 --> 28:50.500
But I know

28:51.020 --> 28:52.540
in every battle between immortals and demons,

28:52.540 --> 28:53.740
not only demons died,

28:54.020 --> 28:56.040
but also the disciples of Immortal Palace.

28:56.040 --> 28:57.800
But if the demon world is united,

28:57.800 --> 29:00.370
the three worlds can avoid such casualties.

29:02.690 --> 29:04.180
I agree with Liu Shao.

29:06.950 --> 29:07.900
Master Shang.

29:09.660 --> 29:10.860
Her words make sense.

29:11.060 --> 29:12.060
Immortal Master,

29:12.420 --> 29:14.280
don't you want to sacrifice less?

29:18.900 --> 29:19.980
But these

29:20.100 --> 29:21.460
are just your own ideas.

29:21.580 --> 29:22.300
I also think

29:22.420 --> 29:24.980
we shouldn't decide this with one person's opinion.

29:24.980 --> 29:27.980
We should let everyone in the Immortal Palace decide.

29:36.060 --> 29:36.860
I know.

29:37.610 --> 29:39.980
Every year, the Immortal Palace will send people

29:39.980 --> 29:42.860
to the mortal world to help Marquis Wuyang's Mansion kill demons.

29:42.860 --> 29:44.660
I was once in Marquis Wuyang's Mansion

29:44.660 --> 29:48.190
so I know you are the ones who are really in danger to kill demons.

29:48.460 --> 29:49.700
They said it's a practice.

29:49.700 --> 29:51.460
But you do know

29:51.460 --> 29:52.780
how many immortal cultivators

29:52.780 --> 29:54.460
die because of that every year.

29:54.460 --> 29:57.060
If it's really like what He Na said,

29:57.420 --> 29:59.250
there is a Demon King in the demon world,

29:59.250 --> 30:01.570
and the demons will be restrained and stop rebelling.

30:01.570 --> 30:03.940
Then you don't have to take any more risks.

30:04.980 --> 30:06.060
Even if he fails,

30:06.260 --> 30:08.060
will it be worse than now?

30:09.580 --> 30:11.740
Why don't you let him try?

30:12.490 --> 30:13.700
If anyone here

30:14.340 --> 30:15.980
agrees to He Na's suggestion,

30:15.980 --> 30:16.910
raise your hand.

30:36.740 --> 30:37.260
Senior.

30:45.180 --> 30:46.940
35 versus 35, even.

30:51.100 --> 30:52.630
It's useless if we are even.

30:52.980 --> 30:53.660
Dismiss.

30:57.940 --> 30:59.400
I'll give you three years.

31:00.020 --> 31:02.220
I want the letter of surrender from the four clans in the demon world.

31:02.220 --> 31:03.080
If you can do it,

31:03.540 --> 31:05.000
your brother will be free.

31:07.540 --> 31:08.140
Ge...

31:11.700 --> 31:12.220
OK.

31:12.700 --> 31:14.860
36 versus 35.

31:15.140 --> 31:15.930
Liu Shao won.

31:20.820 --> 31:22.420
This is the responsibility of Immortal Palace.

31:22.420 --> 31:24.220
It concerns the welfare of the three worlds,

31:24.220 --> 31:25.680
not the winning or losing.

31:26.420 --> 31:27.950
She won the heart of people.

31:43.020 --> 31:44.340
You don't have to thank me.

31:44.340 --> 31:45.420
You deserve

31:45.620 --> 31:47.350
to be the Demon King of the Land.

31:48.930 --> 31:50.390
I won't say thank you then.

31:50.780 --> 31:51.310
Liu Shao.

31:52.420 --> 31:52.950
Liu Shao.

31:54.860 --> 31:56.720
Go back to Xiyin Mountain with me.

31:59.620 --> 32:00.550
I'll go with you.

32:00.940 --> 32:01.860
I want to see Fu.

32:02.540 --> 32:03.100
No.

32:05.330 --> 32:07.140
Your brother has always been cunning.

32:07.140 --> 32:08.600
It's better not to see him.

32:11.580 --> 32:13.260
Then I'll have a few more words with Liu Shao.

32:13.260 --> 32:14.060
No.

32:20.500 --> 32:21.100
Immortal.

32:22.220 --> 32:22.820
I think...

32:22.860 --> 32:24.860
You need to subdue four demon clans.

32:25.260 --> 32:26.380
You must be busy.

32:27.260 --> 32:28.520
I won't keep you today.

32:31.540 --> 32:32.600
-I'm leaving. -Go.

32:33.100 --> 32:33.540
Bye.

33:08.260 --> 33:09.140
Hey,

33:10.540 --> 33:11.780
can't you be quiet?

33:15.090 --> 33:17.140
I'm quite quiet.

33:18.890 --> 33:21.380
I just remembered something Lu Li said.

33:25.300 --> 33:26.500
Do you want to hear it?

33:27.620 --> 33:28.180
No.

33:32.020 --> 33:33.500
Lu Li

33:33.810 --> 33:34.900
once said

33:35.140 --> 33:38.700
he liked fish slices in vinegar the most.

33:39.420 --> 33:41.980
I think you

33:42.210 --> 33:43.700
also like

33:43.980 --> 33:45.780
fish slices in vinegar the most.

33:59.460 --> 34:00.050
Sorry.

34:00.820 --> 34:02.420
I missed the target just now.

34:04.100 --> 34:05.660
You don't want to bully that girl,

34:05.660 --> 34:06.820
so you bully me.

34:07.100 --> 34:08.300
Lu Li is like that too.

34:11.610 --> 34:14.699
Why do you want to see Wan Sui?

34:16.100 --> 34:18.030
Luo Ning's birthday is in two days.

34:18.179 --> 34:19.380
I promised to give her

34:19.500 --> 34:21.699
the unique flowers in the three worlds.

34:22.940 --> 34:24.449
Now you think of me.

34:25.139 --> 34:25.780
Tell me.

34:26.179 --> 34:27.580
What flowers do you want?

34:29.139 --> 34:30.070
What do you have?

34:30.659 --> 34:31.590
That's too many.

34:31.739 --> 34:32.800
Listen carefully.

34:33.820 --> 34:36.210
Red peony, green peony, hyacinth,

34:36.210 --> 34:39.179
colourful embroidered ball, albizzia flowers, white camellia,

34:39.179 --> 34:41.300
purple waterlily, and yucca rigida.

34:42.620 --> 34:43.300
That's all?

34:44.580 --> 34:45.440
Not satisfied?

34:48.020 --> 34:49.540
So you want

34:49.739 --> 34:50.739
a fancy way,

34:50.980 --> 34:52.239
the grassroots style.

34:54.420 --> 34:56.139
Then there is only the dog's tail grass.

34:56.139 --> 34:58.270
I don't think Fairy has seen it before.

35:05.740 --> 35:06.940
Still not satisfied?

35:08.620 --> 35:09.780
That's all I have.

35:10.300 --> 35:10.760
Well...

35:11.420 --> 35:13.100
There is no flower

35:13.460 --> 35:15.790
that Fairy has never seen in three worlds.

35:19.780 --> 35:20.580
I have an idea.

35:22.620 --> 35:23.220
Follow me.

35:38.410 --> 35:39.420
Perfect.

35:39.660 --> 35:42.020
You really forgot my birthday.

35:44.700 --> 35:45.540
This month,

35:45.820 --> 35:46.980
I won't talk to you.

35:51.060 --> 35:51.620
Brother.

35:57.060 --> 35:58.580
You are so busy

35:58.700 --> 36:00.460
but you still found time to come here.

36:00.460 --> 36:01.220
I guess

36:01.340 --> 36:02.420
you must have

36:02.460 --> 36:04.780
prepared an exquisite gift for your sister.

36:04.780 --> 36:05.530
Goodness.

36:05.860 --> 36:07.540
What did you say last time?

36:08.700 --> 36:10.500
You said you will give me

36:10.740 --> 36:12.700
the unique flowers

36:13.140 --> 36:15.200
that I've never seen in three worlds.

36:17.090 --> 36:18.090
Where's the gift?

36:18.460 --> 36:19.260
What's wrong?

36:20.140 --> 36:21.100
You don't want it?

36:21.100 --> 36:23.100
If you don't want it, I'm going back.

36:23.580 --> 36:25.110
Of course I want you to come.

36:25.300 --> 36:26.540
It's my birthday today.

36:26.540 --> 36:27.420
I'm not stupid.

36:28.580 --> 36:30.240
Where are the unique flowers?

36:31.260 --> 36:31.790
Liu Shao.

36:45.390 --> 36:47.790
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

37:05.780 --> 37:07.240
During the end of a season,

37:07.820 --> 37:09.680
flowers will bloom beautifully,

37:10.100 --> 37:12.230
cleaning off all the superficiality.

37:12.700 --> 37:13.460
Hand in hand.

37:14.300 --> 37:16.100
Spend the rest of life together.

37:29.340 --> 37:29.820
This...

37:30.180 --> 37:31.660
This is so beautiful.

37:31.980 --> 37:33.500
Is this snowflake?

37:34.580 --> 37:35.660
Liu Shao, look.

37:36.140 --> 37:37.660
I've never seen

37:37.820 --> 37:38.860
such a big

37:39.140 --> 37:40.700
and beautiful snowflake.

37:41.060 --> 37:42.320
This is not snowflake.

37:42.780 --> 37:44.110
This is Weiyang flower.

37:45.300 --> 37:46.620
Weiyang flower?

37:48.140 --> 37:49.420
Liu Shao, is what you just said

37:49.420 --> 37:51.150
the meaning of Weiyang flower?

37:51.260 --> 37:52.220
So beautiful.

37:52.460 --> 37:53.260
Do you like it?

37:54.020 --> 37:55.100
I like it so much.

37:56.020 --> 37:57.380
You're the best.

37:58.060 --> 37:58.620
Luo Ning.

37:59.180 --> 38:00.220
Liu Shao has prepared a banquet

38:00.220 --> 38:01.420
in the garden.

38:01.900 --> 38:03.100
See if you like it.

38:03.540 --> 38:03.980
Okay.

38:05.020 --> 38:06.080
Let's go, Liu Shao.

38:06.380 --> 38:07.020
Let's go.

38:07.660 --> 38:08.660
Brother, come on.

38:12.100 --> 38:12.940
Let's go.

38:13.380 --> 38:15.140
Let's go eat something delicious.

38:15.140 --> 38:15.860
Darn it.

38:16.620 --> 38:18.130
All these should be mine.

38:18.380 --> 38:19.460
Liu Shao, try this.

38:19.500 --> 38:20.020
Okay.

38:23.940 --> 38:25.180
Let's drink.

38:25.420 --> 38:28.020
How dare a demon sneak into the Xiyin Mountain?

38:28.340 --> 38:30.340
Come and see me.

38:40.660 --> 38:41.320
Who are you?

38:48.100 --> 38:49.060
General Fu

38:49.700 --> 38:51.100
from the Aquatic Demons.

38:51.420 --> 38:53.550
The brother of the Demon King in White?

38:53.850 --> 38:56.300
The demon aura in your body is hidden so well.

38:56.300 --> 38:58.300
Did you use Lu Sheng’s magic weapon?

38:59.660 --> 39:00.590
Unfortunately,

39:01.220 --> 39:02.350
you can fool others,

39:02.940 --> 39:03.780
but not me.

39:04.780 --> 39:06.580
Even though I'm in decline now,

39:07.060 --> 39:09.460
I'm still the descendant of the Demon King.

39:09.500 --> 39:10.940
I can see the demon energy

39:11.290 --> 39:13.140
in your body clearly.

39:13.580 --> 39:14.780
I don't have any demon aura.

39:14.780 --> 39:15.980
Don't try to trick me.

39:16.060 --> 39:17.220
I'm not that stupid.

39:34.820 --> 39:35.880
It's interesting.

39:36.930 --> 39:39.340
The demon energy in your body is from Ao Hen.

39:40.660 --> 39:42.810
You got a big advantage.

39:44.020 --> 39:45.330
What do you want?

39:50.940 --> 39:52.270
Did your master Lu Sheng

39:52.500 --> 39:53.980
die recently?

39:54.700 --> 39:55.580
How do you know?

39:58.060 --> 39:59.180
Not only do I know,

40:00.140 --> 40:01.930
I also know who killed him.

40:02.740 --> 40:03.300
Who?

40:07.900 --> 40:09.360
Is a very important person

40:09.900 --> 40:11.540
celebrating the birthday today

40:11.540 --> 40:12.600
in Xiyin Mountain?

40:14.500 --> 40:16.300
The sister of Immortal Luo Ge,

40:16.580 --> 40:17.860
Fairy Luo Ning.

40:22.980 --> 40:23.700
Tell me

40:24.020 --> 40:25.450
who killed my master.

40:27.420 --> 40:29.450
Give this fairy a gift for me.

40:30.260 --> 40:31.580
After that,

40:32.610 --> 40:33.580
I'll tell you.

40:37.940 --> 40:38.860
Slow down.

40:40.170 --> 40:40.700
Liu Shao.

40:40.900 --> 40:42.540
I like you so much.

40:43.140 --> 40:43.860
Thank you

40:44.340 --> 40:47.740
for giving me such a happy birthday.

40:48.170 --> 40:50.540
As long as you are happy.

40:50.940 --> 40:52.020
Let me tell you.

40:57.540 --> 40:58.270
Are you okay?

40:58.940 --> 40:59.980
No.

41:03.620 --> 41:04.340
Brother.

41:04.860 --> 41:05.700
You...

41:06.300 --> 41:07.740
You like her.

41:08.220 --> 41:09.140
I know.

41:09.580 --> 41:11.110
What are you talking about?

41:18.540 --> 41:19.220
Brother.

41:19.460 --> 41:21.820
I'm so happy that you're back.

41:22.140 --> 41:24.580
I finally don't have to look out every day

41:24.820 --> 41:26.900
and miss you day by day.

41:27.020 --> 41:28.580
I miss you so much.

41:28.740 --> 41:30.820
I'm glad you're alive.

41:31.940 --> 41:33.500
I...

41:35.980 --> 41:37.020
Liu Shao.

41:37.020 --> 41:38.900
My brother is really really good.

41:38.900 --> 41:39.940
Am I right?

41:40.890 --> 41:41.780
No.

41:43.300 --> 41:44.100
Okay.

41:44.180 --> 41:45.180
He's not

41:45.500 --> 41:46.300
your brother.

41:46.580 --> 41:48.580
He is my Lu Li.

41:49.580 --> 41:50.060
Right.

41:50.540 --> 41:51.380
Good taste.

41:53.780 --> 41:54.940
You know what?

41:55.460 --> 41:57.900
You had been with me

41:58.340 --> 42:00.070
for so long in the mortal world.

42:00.140 --> 42:01.500
You should

42:01.690 --> 42:02.550
spend more time

42:02.940 --> 42:03.940
with your sister.

42:04.260 --> 42:05.260
Keep her company!

42:06.020 --> 42:07.020
Keep her company.

42:08.060 --> 42:09.190
No need to see me off.

42:12.460 --> 42:13.580
Don't see me off.

42:14.860 --> 42:15.620
Luo Ning.

42:15.740 --> 42:16.500
Bye.
